---
// Kontak Section - Final Call to Action
---
<section id="kontak" class="py-32 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center overflow-hidden">
  <div class="relative py-20 md:py-28 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white dark:from-slate-900/80 dark:to-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300" data-aos="zoom-in">

    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none rounded-full"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -right-20 w-64 h-64 bg-cyan-500/5 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none rounded-full"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-400 rounded-full mb-8 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-800">
        Let's Collaborate
      </span>

      <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-6 tracking-tighter leading-tight">
        Siap untuk <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 dark:from-blue-400 dark:to-cyan-300">Memulai</span>
        <br />Projectmu?
      </h3>

      <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-10 leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Setiap ide besar dimulai dari satu percakapan. Hubungi saya dan mari kita diskusikan bagaimana solusi digital dapat mewujudkan visi Anda.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/kontak"
           class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-white dark:text-slate-950 text-white rounded-2xl font-bold hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <span>Hubungi Saya</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/6285811591772" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-900 hover:border-green-500/30 transition-all duration-300 text-sm">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/>
          </svg>
          WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
